  "steps": [
    "Cook the ash gourd with turmeric, salt and half a cup of water until just tender, about 8 minutes.",
    "Grind the coconut, green chilli, cumin seeds and rice flour to a smooth paste with a little water.",
    "Whisk the curd until smooth and stir in the ground paste.",
    "Lower the heat to the minimum, pour the curd mixture over the vegetables and warm for 5-6 minutes, stirring constantly; do not let it boil or the curd will split.",
    "Heat the coconut oil, crackle the mustard seeds and fenugreek seeds, then add dried red chilli, hing and curry leaves.",
    "Pour the tempering over the kuzhambu and serve with rice."
  ]
